    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91769" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύρν-ον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wheaten bread</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				15.312
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				17.12
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				362
			</span></i>; esp. of bread with the bran in it, Philem.Gloss. ap. <i><span class="en">
