			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> generally,
				<i>food, meat</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φήγινον π</span>.
